Lojban (with a few extras), but got stuck on describing that kind of 
"closed". There are two other words for different senses of the word 
({ganlo} = closed passageway; {tolgubni} = closed group/source &c), but 
there's a bit more to a closed school/shop than the windows and doors being 
closed.

